[statement]
As `a-real-name-with-two-candidates-before-a-virtual-one`, in a request:
asked for `v` and `x`, apk decides `x` first, and its dependency `p2`
answers `v`.

[repository]
P:p1
V:1
p:v
k:100

P:p2
V:1
p:v
k:10

P:x
V:1.0

P:x
V:2.0
D:p2


[request]
v
x

[answer apk-tools 3.0.9-r0]
install p2 1
install x 2.0
